      `the decision is taken in a manner that causes or is reasonably likely to cause that person, another person or group of persons significant harm` IS A BOOLEAN @desc Is it true that the decision is taken in a manner that causes or is reasonably likely to cause that person, another person or group of persons significant harm?
GIVETH A MAYBE BOOLEAN
DECIDE `Under Article 5, as a deployer of an AI system, is my use of an AI system prohibited by Article 5(1)(a) (subliminal, manipulative or deceptive techniques that distort behaviour)` IS
