      `the use is for any of the objectives referred to in paragraph 1, first subparagraph, point (h)` IS A BOOLEAN @desc Is it true that the use is for any of the objectives referred to in paragraph 1, first subparagraph, point (h)?
      `the law enforcement authority has completed a fundamental rights impact assessment as provided for in Article 27` IS A BOOLEAN @desc Is it true that the law enforcement authority has completed a fundamental rights impact assessment as provided for in Article 27?
      `the law enforcement authority has registered the system in the EU database according to Article 49` IS A BOOLEAN @desc Is it true that the law enforcement authority has registered the system in the EU database according to Article 49?
