DECIDE `Under Article 5, as a deployer of an AI system, does my use satisfy the conditions of Article 5(2) for being authorised` IS
    `Art 5(2) the use satisfies the conditions for being authorised` `the date asked` `the use is of a 'real-time' remote biometric identification system in publicly accessible spaces for the purposes of law enforcement` `the use is for any of the objectives referred to in paragraph 1, first subparagraph, point (h)` `the law enforcement authority has completed a fundamental rights impact assessment as provided for in Article 27` `the law enforcement authority has registered the system in the EU database according to Article 49` `the case is a duly justified case of urgency` `the registration is completed without undue delay`
