        `the use is for the purposes of law enforcement` MEANS
            `Art 3(46) the activities are law enforcement` `the use is carried out by law enforcement authorities` `the use is carried out on behalf of law enforcement authorities` `the use is for the prevention, investigation, detection or prosecution of criminal offences or the execution of criminal penalties, including safeguarding against and preventing threats to public security`
        `the use is of a 'real-time' remote biometric identification system in publicly accessible spaces for the purposes of law enforcement` MEANS
            (`the AI system is a 'real-time' remote biometric identification system`) AND (`the system is used in publicly accessible spaces`) AND (`the use is for the purposes of law enforcement`)

