      `such limitation does not reduce the overall level of protection provided for by this Regulation` IS A BOOLEAN @desc Would limiting the application of the requirement or obligation this question is about leave the overall level of protection provided by this Regulation undiminished? Answer no if you do not know.
      `the high-risk AI system is referred to in point 1 (a), of Annex III` IS A BOOLEAN @desc Is the high-risk AI system one referred to in point 1(a) of Annex III (a remote biometric identification system, not one used only for biometric verification to confirm that a specific natural person is who they claim to be)?
      `the logging capabilities provide a recording of the period of each use of the system (start date and time and end date and time of each use)` IS A BOOLEAN @desc For the AI system you use, is it the case that the logging capabilities provide a recording of the period of each use of the system (start date and time and end date and time of each use)?
      `the logging capabilities provide a record of the reference database against which input data has been checked by the system` IS A BOOLEAN @desc For the AI system you use, is it the case that the logging capabilities provide a record of the reference database against which input data has been checked by the system?
