    `Art 13(2) the high-risk AI system is accompanied by instructions for use that include concise, complete, correct and clear information` `the date asked` `the AI system as stated` `the harmonisation facts as stated` `the high-risk AI system is accompanied by instructions for use in an appropriate digital format or otherwise` `the instructions for use include concise, complete, correct and clear information` `the information is relevant, accessible and comprehensible to deployers`
    WHERE
        `the AI system as stated` MEANS `AI system` WITH
            `date placed on the market or put into service` IS `the date the AI system was placed on the market or put into service`
            `route` IS `the route by which the AI system is high-risk`
            `significantly changed in its design since the date of application of Chapter III` IS `the AI system has been significantly changed in its design since the date of application of Chapter III`
        `the harmonisation facts as stated` MEANS `Arts 8 to 15 harmonisation facts` WITH
            `the products are covered by Union harmonisation legislation listed in Section B of Annex I` IS `the products are covered by Union harmonisation legislation listed in Section B of Annex I`
            `Union harmonisation legislation listed in Section A of Annex I lays down requirements or obligations providing an equivalent or higher level of protection of health, safety or fundamental rights as the requirement or obligation concerned` IS `Union harmonisation legislation listed in Section A of Annex I lays down requirements or obligations providing an equivalent or higher level of protection of health, safety or fundamental rights as the requirement or obligation concerned`
            `such limitation does not reduce the overall level of protection provided for by this Regulation` IS `such limitation does not reduce the overall level of protection provided for by this Regulation`

@export Under Article 13(3), as a deployer of an AI system, do the instructions for use of the high-risk AI system I use contain at least the information the paragraph lists?
GIVEN `the date asked` IS A DATE @desc On what date do you want the answer? Give today's date for the Regulation as it stands today, or an earlier or later date for the Regulation as it stood or will stand then.
      `the route by which the AI system is high-risk` IS A `Route to high-risk` @desc Is the AI system high-risk because of Article 6(1) with Annex I, because of Article 6(2) with Annex III, or neither?
      `the date the AI system was placed on the market or put into service` IS A DATE @desc On what date was the AI system first placed on the market or put into service in the Union? If that has not happened yet, give the date you expect.
      `the AI system has been significantly changed in its design since the date of application of Chapter III` IS A BOOLEAN @desc Since the date from which Chapter III of the Regulation applies to your AI system, has its design been significantly changed? Answer no if you do not know of a significant change.
      `the products are covered by Union harmonisation legislation listed in Section B of Annex I` IS A BOOLEAN @desc Is the AI system related to products covered by the Union harmonisation legislation listed in Section B of Annex I? Answer no if you do not know of such legislation.
      `Union harmonisation legislation listed in Section A of Annex I lays down requirements or obligations providing an equivalent or higher level of protection of health, safety or fundamental rights as the requirement or obligation concerned` IS A BOOLEAN @desc Does Union harmonisation legislation listed in Section A of Annex I lay down requirements or obligations providing an equivalent or higher level of protection of health, safety or fundamental rights than the requirement or obligation this question is about? Answer no if you do not know of such legislation.
      `such limitation does not reduce the overall level of protection provided for by this Regulation` IS A BOOLEAN @desc Would limiting the application of the requirement or obligation this question is about leave the overall level of protection provided by this Regulation undiminished? Answer no if you do not know.
      `the instructions for use contain the identity and the contact details of the provider and, where applicable, of its authorised representative` IS A BOOLEAN @desc Do the instructions for use contain the identity and the contact details of the provider and, where there is one, of its authorised representative?
      `the instructions for use contain the characteristics, capabilities and limitations of performance of the high-risk AI system` IS A BOOLEAN @desc For the AI system you use, is it the case that the instructions for use contain the characteristics, capabilities and limitations of performance of the high-risk AI system?
      `the instructions for use contain its intended purpose` IS A BOOLEAN @desc For the AI system you use, is it the case that the instructions for use contain its intended purpose?
      `the instructions for use contain the level of accuracy, including its metrics, robustness and cybersecurity referred to in Article 15 against which the high-risk AI system has been tested and validated and which can be expected, and any known and foreseeable circumstances that may have an impact on that expected level of accuracy, robustness and cybersecurity` IS A BOOLEAN @desc For the AI system you use, is it the case that the instructions for use contain the level of accuracy, including its metrics, robustness and cybersecurity referred to in Article 15 against which the high-risk AI system has been tested and validated and which can be expected, and any known and foreseeable circumstances that may have an impact on that expected level of accuracy, robustness and cybersecurity?
      `the instructions for use contain any known or foreseeable circumstance, related to the use of the high-risk AI system in accordance with its intended purpose or under conditions of reasonably foreseeable misuse, which may lead to risks to the health and safety or fundamental rights referred to in Article 9(2)` IS A BOOLEAN @desc For the AI system you use, is it the case that the instructions for use contain any known or foreseeable circumstance, related to the use of the high-risk AI system in accordance with its intended purpose or under conditions of reasonably foreseeable misuse, which may lead to risks to the health and safety or fundamental rights referred to in Article 9(2)?
      `the instructions for use contain where applicable, the technical capabilities and characteristics of the high-risk AI system to provide information that is relevant to explain its output` IS A BOOLEAN @desc Where it is applicable, do the instructions for use contain the technical capabilities and characteristics of the high-risk AI system to provide information that is relevant to explain its output? Answer yes if it is not applicable.
      `the instructions for use contain when appropriate, its performance regarding specific persons or groups of persons on which the system is intended to be used` IS A BOOLEAN @desc When it is appropriate, do the instructions for use contain the performance of the high-risk AI system regarding specific persons or groups of persons on which it is intended to be used? Answer yes if it is not appropriate.
      `the instructions for use contain when appropriate, specifications for the input data, or any other relevant information in terms of the training, validation and testing data sets used, taking into account the intended purpose of the high-risk AI system` IS A BOOLEAN @desc When it is appropriate, do the instructions for use contain specifications for the input data, or any other relevant information in terms of the training, validation and testing data sets used, taking into account the intended purpose? Answer yes if it is not appropriate.
      `the instructions for use contain where applicable, information to enable deployers to interpret the output of the high-risk AI system and use it appropriately` IS A BOOLEAN @desc Where it is applicable, do the instructions for use contain information to enable deployers to interpret the output of the high-risk AI system and use it appropriately? Answer yes if it is not applicable.
      `the instructions for use contain the changes to the high-risk AI system and its performance which have been pre-determined by the provider at the moment of the initial conformity assessment, if any` IS A BOOLEAN @desc Do the instructions for use contain the changes to the high-risk AI system and its performance which the provider pre-determined at the moment of the initial conformity assessment, if there are any? Answer yes if it is not applicable.
      `the instructions for use contain the human oversight measures referred to in Article 14, including the technical measures put in place to facilitate the interpretation of the outputs of the high-risk AI systems by the deployers` IS A BOOLEAN @desc For the AI system you use, is it the case that the instructions for use contain the human oversight measures referred to in Article 14, including the technical measures put in place to facilitate the interpretation of the outputs of the high-risk AI systems by the deployers?
      `the instructions for use contain the computational and hardware resources needed, the expected lifetime of the high-risk AI system and any necessary maintenance and care measures, including their frequency, to ensure the proper functioning of that AI system, including as regards software updates` IS A BOOLEAN @desc For the AI system you use, is it the case that the instructions for use contain the computational and hardware resources needed, the expected lifetime of the high-risk AI system and any necessary maintenance and care measures, including their frequency, to ensure the proper functioning of that AI system, including as regards software updates?
      `the instructions for use contain where relevant, a description of the mechanisms included within the high-risk AI system that allows deployers to properly collect, store and interpret the logs in accordance with Article 12` IS A BOOLEAN @desc Where it is relevant, do the instructions for use contain a description of the mechanisms included within the high-risk AI system that allow deployers to properly collect, store and interpret the logs in accordance with Article 12? Answer yes if it is not relevant.
GIVETH A MAYBE BOOLEAN
DECIDE `Under Article 13(3), as a deployer of an AI system, do the instructions for use of the high-risk AI system I use contain at least the information the paragraph lists` IS
    `Art 13(3) the instructions for use contain at least the following information` `the date asked` `the AI system as stated` `the harmonisation facts as stated` `the instructions for use contain the identity and the contact details of the provider and, where applicable, of its authorised representative` `the instructions for use contain the characteristics, capabilities and limitations of performance of the high-risk AI system` `the instructions for use contain its intended purpose` `the instructions for use contain the level of accuracy, including its metrics, robustness and cybersecurity referred to in Article 15 against which the high-risk AI system has been tested and validated and which can be expected, and any known and foreseeable circumstances that may have an impact on that expected level of accuracy, robustness and cybersecurity` `the instructions for use contain any known or foreseeable circumstance, related to the use of the high-risk AI system in accordance with its intended purpose or under conditions of reasonably foreseeable misuse, which may lead to risks to the health and safety or fundamental rights referred to in Article 9(2)` `the instructions for use contain where applicable, the technical capabilities and characteristics of the high-risk AI system to provide information that is relevant to explain its output` `the instructions for use contain when appropriate, its performance regarding specific persons or groups of persons on which the system is intended to be used` `the instructions for use contain when appropriate, specifications for the input data, or any other relevant information in terms of the training, validation and testing data sets used, taking into account the intended purpose of the high-risk AI system` `the instructions for use contain where applicable, information to enable deployers to interpret the output of the high-risk AI system and use it appropriately` `the instructions for use contain the changes to the high-risk AI system and its performance which have been pre-determined by the provider at the moment of the initial conformity assessment, if any` `the instructions for use contain the human oversight measures referred to in Article 14, including the technical measures put in place to facilitate the interpretation of the outputs of the high-risk AI systems by the deployers` `the instructions for use contain the computational and hardware resources needed, the expected lifetime of the high-risk AI system and any necessary maintenance and care measures, including their frequency, to ensure the proper functioning of that AI system, including as regards software updates` `the instructions for use contain where relevant, a description of the mechanisms included within the high-risk AI system that allows deployers to properly collect, store and interpret the logs in accordance with Article 12`
    WHERE
        `the AI system as stated` MEANS `AI system` WITH
            `date placed on the market or put into service` IS `the date the AI system was placed on the market or put into service`
            `route` IS `the route by which the AI system is high-risk`
            `significantly changed in its design since the date of application of Chapter III` IS `the AI system has been significantly changed in its design since the date of application of Chapter III`
        `the harmonisation facts as stated` MEANS `Arts 8 to 15 harmonisation facts` WITH
            `the products are covered by Union harmonisation legislation listed in Section B of Annex I` IS `the products are covered by Union harmonisation legislation listed in Section B of Annex I`
            `Union harmonisation legislation listed in Section A of Annex I lays down requirements or obligations providing an equivalent or higher level of protection of health, safety or fundamental rights as the requirement or obligation concerned` IS `Union harmonisation legislation listed in Section A of Annex I lays down requirements or obligations providing an equivalent or higher level of protection of health, safety or fundamental rights as the requirement or obligation concerned`
