@export Under Article 14(4), as a deployer of an AI system, is the high-risk AI system provided to me in such a way that the natural persons to whom I assign human oversight are enabled, as appropriate and proportionate, to do each of the five things the paragraph lists?
GIVEN `the date asked` IS A DATE @desc On what date do you want the answer? Give today's date for the Regulation as it stands today, or an earlier or later date for the Regulation as it stood or will stand then.
      `the route by which the AI system is high-risk` IS A `Route to high-risk` @desc Is the AI system high-risk because of Article 6(1) with Annex I, because of Article 6(2) with Annex III, or neither?
      `the date the AI system was placed on the market or put into service` IS A DATE @desc On what date was the AI system first placed on the market or put into service in the Union? If that has not happened yet, give the date you expect.
      `the AI system has been significantly changed in its design since the date of application of Chapter III` IS A BOOLEAN @desc Since the date from which Chapter III of the Regulation applies to your AI system, has its design been significantly changed? Answer no if you do not know of a significant change.
      `the products are covered by Union harmonisation legislation listed in Section B of Annex I` IS A BOOLEAN @desc Is the AI system related to products covered by the Union harmonisation legislation listed in Section B of Annex I? Answer no if you do not know of such legislation.
      `Union harmonisation legislation listed in Section A of Annex I lays down requirements or obligations providing an equivalent or higher level of protection of health, safety or fundamental rights as the requirement or obligation concerned` IS A BOOLEAN @desc Does Union harmonisation legislation listed in Section A of Annex I lay down requirements or obligations providing an equivalent or higher level of protection of health, safety or fundamental rights than the requirement or obligation this question is about? Answer no if you do not know of such legislation.
      `such limitation does not reduce the overall level of protection provided for by this Regulation` IS A BOOLEAN @desc Would limiting the application of the requirement or obligation this question is about leave the overall level of protection provided by this Regulation undiminished? Answer no if you do not know.
      `the high-risk AI system is provided to the deployer in such a way that the natural persons to whom human oversight is assigned are enabled, as appropriate and proportionate, to do the things listed` IS A BOOLEAN @desc Is the high-risk AI system provided to the deployer in such a way that the natural persons to whom human oversight is assigned are enabled, as appropriate and proportionate, to do the things the next five questions list?
      `the natural persons are enabled, as appropriate and proportionate, to properly understand the relevant capacities and limitations of the high-risk AI system and to duly monitor its operation, including in view of detecting and addressing anomalies, dysfunctions and unexpected performance` IS A BOOLEAN @desc Are they enabled to properly understand the relevant capacities and limitations of the high-risk AI system and to duly monitor its operation, including in view of detecting and addressing anomalies, dysfunctions and unexpected performance? Answer yes if that is not appropriate and proportionate.
      `the natural persons are enabled, as appropriate and proportionate, to remain aware of the possible tendency of automatically relying or over-relying on the output produced by the high-risk AI system (automation bias)` IS A BOOLEAN @desc Are they enabled to remain aware of the possible tendency of automatically relying or over-relying on the output produced by the high-risk AI system (automation bias)? Answer yes if that is not appropriate and proportionate.
      `the natural persons are enabled, as appropriate and proportionate, to correctly interpret the output of the high-risk AI system, taking into account, for example, the interpretation tools and methods available` IS A BOOLEAN @desc Are they enabled to correctly interpret the output of the high-risk AI system, taking into account, for example, the interpretation tools and methods available? Answer yes if that is not appropriate and proportionate.
      `the natural persons are enabled, as appropriate and proportionate, to decide, in any particular situation, not to use the high-risk AI system or to otherwise disregard, override or reverse its output` IS A BOOLEAN @desc Are they enabled to decide, in any particular situation, not to use the high-risk AI system or to otherwise disregard, override or reverse its output? Answer yes if that is not appropriate and proportionate.
      `the natural persons are enabled, as appropriate and proportionate, to intervene in the operation of the high-risk AI system or interrupt it through a 'stop' button or a similar procedure that allows the system to come to a halt in a safe state` IS A BOOLEAN @desc Are they enabled to intervene in the operation of the high-risk AI system or interrupt it through a 'stop' button or a similar procedure that allows the system to come to a halt in a safe state? Answer yes if that is not appropriate and proportionate.
GIVETH A MAYBE BOOLEAN
DECIDE `Under Article 14(4), as a deployer of an AI system, is the high-risk AI system provided to me in such a way that the natural persons to whom I assign human oversight are enabled, as appropriate and proportionate, to do each of the five things the paragraph lists` IS
    `Art 14(4) the high-risk AI system is provided to the deployer so that the natural persons to whom human oversight is assigned are enabled to do the following` `the date asked` `the AI system as stated` `the harmonisation facts as stated` `the high-risk AI system is provided to the deployer in such a way that the natural persons to whom human oversight is assigned are enabled, as appropriate and proportionate, to do the things listed` `the natural persons are enabled, as appropriate and proportionate, to properly understand the relevant capacities and limitations of the high-risk AI system and to duly monitor its operation, including in view of detecting and addressing anomalies, dysfunctions and unexpected performance` `the natural persons are enabled, as appropriate and proportionate, to remain aware of the possible tendency of automatically relying or over-relying on the output produced by the high-risk AI system (automation bias)` `the natural persons are enabled, as appropriate and proportionate, to correctly interpret the output of the high-risk AI system, taking into account, for example, the interpretation tools and methods available` `the natural persons are enabled, as appropriate and proportionate, to decide, in any particular situation, not to use the high-risk AI system or to otherwise disregard, override or reverse its output` `the natural persons are enabled, as appropriate and proportionate, to intervene in the operation of the high-risk AI system or interrupt it through a 'stop' button or a similar procedure that allows the system to come to a halt in a safe state`
    WHERE
