      `the high-risk AI system is designed and developed in such a way that it achieves an appropriate level of accuracy` IS A BOOLEAN @desc For the AI system you use, is it the case that the high-risk AI system is designed and developed in such a way that it achieves an appropriate level of accuracy?
      `the high-risk AI system is designed and developed in such a way that it achieves an appropriate level of robustness` IS A BOOLEAN @desc For the AI system you use, is it the case that the high-risk AI system is designed and developed in such a way that it achieves an appropriate level of robustness?
      `the high-risk AI system is designed and developed in such a way that it achieves an appropriate level of cybersecurity` IS A BOOLEAN @desc For the AI system you use, is it the case that the high-risk AI system is designed and developed in such a way that it achieves an appropriate level of cybersecurity?
      `the high-risk AI system is designed and developed in such a way that it performs consistently in those respects throughout its lifecycle` IS A BOOLEAN @desc For the AI system you use, is it the case that the high-risk AI system is designed and developed in such a way that it performs consistently in those respects throughout its lifecycle?
