      `the AI system has been significantly changed in its design since the date of application of Chapter III` IS A BOOLEAN @desc Since the date from which Chapter III of the Regulation applies to your AI system, has its design been significantly changed? Answer no if you do not know of a significant change.
      `the products are covered by Union harmonisation legislation listed in Section B of Annex I` IS A BOOLEAN @desc Is the AI system related to products covered by the Union harmonisation legislation listed in Section B of Annex I? Answer no if you do not know of such legislation.
      `Union harmonisation legislation listed in Section A of Annex I lays down requirements or obligations providing an equivalent or higher level of protection of health, safety or fundamental rights as the requirement or obligation concerned` IS A BOOLEAN @desc Does Union harmonisation legislation listed in Section A of Annex I lay down requirements or obligations providing an equivalent or higher level of protection of health, safety or fundamental rights than the requirement or obligation this question is about? Answer no if you do not know of such legislation.
      `such limitation does not reduce the overall level of protection provided for by this Regulation` IS A BOOLEAN @desc Would limiting the application of the requirement or obligation this question is about leave the overall level of protection provided by this Regulation undiminished? Answer no if you do not know.
      `the technical solutions aiming to ensure the cybersecurity of the high-risk AI system are appropriate to the relevant circumstances and the risks` IS A BOOLEAN @desc For the AI system you use, is it the case that the technical solutions aiming to ensure the cybersecurity of the high-risk AI system are appropriate to the relevant circumstances and the risks?
GIVETH A MAYBE BOOLEAN
DECIDE `Under Article 15(5), as a deployer of an AI system, in the second subparagraph, are the technical solutions aiming to ensure the cybersecurity of the high-risk AI system I use appropriate to the relevant circumstances and the risks` IS
    `Art 15(5) second subparagraph the technical solutions aiming to ensure cybersecurity are appropriate to the relevant circumstances and the risks` `the date asked` `the AI system as stated` `the harmonisation facts as stated` `the technical solutions aiming to ensure the cybersecurity of the high-risk AI system are appropriate to the relevant circumstances and the risks`
    WHERE
        `the AI system as stated` MEANS `AI system` WITH
            `date placed on the market or put into service` IS `the date the AI system was placed on the market or put into service`
            `route` IS `the route by which the AI system is high-risk`
            `significantly changed in its design since the date of application of Chapter III` IS `the AI system has been significantly changed in its design since the date of application of Chapter III`
        `the harmonisation facts as stated` MEANS `Arts 8 to 15 harmonisation facts` WITH
            `the products are covered by Union harmonisation legislation listed in Section B of Annex I` IS `the products are covered by Union harmonisation legislation listed in Section B of Annex I`
            `Union harmonisation legislation listed in Section A of Annex I lays down requirements or obligations providing an equivalent or higher level of protection of health, safety or fundamental rights as the requirement or obligation concerned` IS `Union harmonisation legislation listed in Section A of Annex I lays down requirements or obligations providing an equivalent or higher level of protection of health, safety or fundamental rights as the requirement or obligation concerned`
            `such limitation does not reduce the overall level of protection provided for by this Regulation` IS `such limitation does not reduce the overall level of protection provided for by this Regulation`

@export Under Article 15(5), as a deployer of an AI system, in the third subparagraph, do the technical solutions of the high-risk AI system I use to address AI specific vulnerabilities include, where appropriate, measures to prevent, detect, respond to, resolve and control for each of the five kinds of attack the subparagraph lists?
GIVEN `the date asked` IS A DATE @desc On what date do you want the answer? Give today's date for the Regulation as it stands today, or an earlier or later date for the Regulation as it stood or will stand then.
      `the route by which the AI system is high-risk` IS A `Route to high-risk` @desc Is the AI system high-risk because of Article 6(1) with Annex I, because of Article 6(2) with Annex III, or neither?
      `the date the AI system was placed on the market or put into service` IS A DATE @desc On what date was the AI system first placed on the market or put into service in the Union? If that has not happened yet, give the date you expect.
      `the AI system has been significantly changed in its design since the date of application of Chapter III` IS A BOOLEAN @desc Since the date from which Chapter III of the Regulation applies to your AI system, has its design been significantly changed? Answer no if you do not know of a significant change.
      `the products are covered by Union harmonisation legislation listed in Section B of Annex I` IS A BOOLEAN @desc Is the AI system related to products covered by the Union harmonisation legislation listed in Section B of Annex I? Answer no if you do not know of such legislation.
      `Union harmonisation legislation listed in Section A of Annex I lays down requirements or obligations providing an equivalent or higher level of protection of health, safety or fundamental rights as the requirement or obligation concerned` IS A BOOLEAN @desc Does Union harmonisation legislation listed in Section A of Annex I lay down requirements or obligations providing an equivalent or higher level of protection of health, safety or fundamental rights than the requirement or obligation this question is about? Answer no if you do not know of such legislation.
      `such limitation does not reduce the overall level of protection provided for by this Regulation` IS A BOOLEAN @desc Would limiting the application of the requirement or obligation this question is about leave the overall level of protection provided by this Regulation undiminished? Answer no if you do not know.
      `the technical solutions include, where appropriate, measures to prevent, detect, respond to, resolve and control for attacks trying to manipulate the training data set (data poisoning)` IS A BOOLEAN @desc Where it is appropriate, do the technical solutions include measures to prevent, detect, respond to, resolve and control for attacks trying to manipulate the training data set (data poisoning)? Answer yes if that is not appropriate.
      `the technical solutions include, where appropriate, measures to prevent, detect, respond to, resolve and control for attacks trying to manipulate pre-trained components used in training (model poisoning)` IS A BOOLEAN @desc Where it is appropriate, do the technical solutions include measures to prevent, detect, respond to, resolve and control for attacks trying to manipulate pre-trained components used in training (model poisoning)? Answer yes if that is not appropriate.
      `the technical solutions include, where appropriate, measures to prevent, detect, respond to, resolve and control for inputs designed to cause the AI model to make a mistake (adversarial examples or model evasion)` IS A BOOLEAN @desc Where it is appropriate, do the technical solutions include measures to prevent, detect, respond to, resolve and control for inputs designed to cause the AI model to make a mistake (adversarial examples or model evasion)? Answer yes if that is not appropriate.
      `the technical solutions include, where appropriate, measures to prevent, detect, respond to, resolve and control for confidentiality attacks` IS A BOOLEAN @desc Where it is appropriate, do the technical solutions include measures to prevent, detect, respond to, resolve and control for confidentiality attacks? Answer yes if that is not appropriate.
      `the technical solutions include, where appropriate, measures to prevent, detect, respond to, resolve and control for model flaws` IS A BOOLEAN @desc Where it is appropriate, do the technical solutions include measures to prevent, detect, respond to, resolve and control for model flaws? Answer yes if that is not appropriate.
GIVETH A MAYBE BOOLEAN
DECIDE `Under Article 15(5), as a deployer of an AI system, in the third subparagraph, do the technical solutions of the high-risk AI system I use to address AI specific vulnerabilities include, where appropriate, measures to prevent, detect, respond to, resolve and control for each of the five kinds of attack the subparagraph lists` IS
    `Art 15(5) third subparagraph the technical solutions to address AI specific vulnerabilities include measures against the listed attacks` `the date asked` `the AI system as stated` `the harmonisation facts as stated` `the technical solutions include, where appropriate, measures to prevent, detect, respond to, resolve and control for attacks trying to manipulate the training data set (data poisoning)` `the technical solutions include, where appropriate, measures to prevent, detect, respond to, resolve and control for attacks trying to manipulate pre-trained components used in training (model poisoning)` `the technical solutions include, where appropriate, measures to prevent, detect, respond to, resolve and control for inputs designed to cause the AI model to make a mistake (adversarial examples or model evasion)` `the technical solutions include, where appropriate, measures to prevent, detect, respond to, resolve and control for confidentiality attacks` `the technical solutions include, where appropriate, measures to prevent, detect, respond to, resolve and control for model flaws`
    WHERE
        `the AI system as stated` MEANS `AI system` WITH
            `date placed on the market or put into service` IS `the date the AI system was placed on the market or put into service`
            `route` IS `the route by which the AI system is high-risk`
            `significantly changed in its design since the date of application of Chapter III` IS `the AI system has been significantly changed in its design since the date of application of Chapter III`
        `the harmonisation facts as stated` MEANS `Arts 8 to 15 harmonisation facts` WITH
            `the products are covered by Union harmonisation legislation listed in Section B of Annex I` IS `the products are covered by Union harmonisation legislation listed in Section B of Annex I`
            `Union harmonisation legislation listed in Section A of Annex I lays down requirements or obligations providing an equivalent or higher level of protection of health, safety or fundamental rights as the requirement or obligation concerned` IS `Union harmonisation legislation listed in Section A of Annex I lays down requirements or obligations providing an equivalent or higher level of protection of health, safety or fundamental rights as the requirement or obligation concerned`
            `such limitation does not reduce the overall level of protection provided for by this Regulation` IS `such limitation does not reduce the overall level of protection provided for by this Regulation`

-- ====================================================================================================
-- seat questions of seat deployer from part P3 (merged; unchanged text follows)
-- ====================================================================================================
-- P3-seat-deployer: the questions of Articles 16 to 27 of the EU Artificial Intelligence Act (Regulation (EU) 2024/1689 as amended by Regulation (EU) 2026/1744), asked as a deployer of an AI system
-- A thin layer: every question calls one decision function of the layer-1 modules and restates no rule. The inputs that all questions of this part share carry the same name and the same description in every question.
-- Reading a result: JUST TRUE yes; JUST FALSE the text says no in its own words; NOTHING the text does not answer (the provision does not yet apply, the list is not closed, the provision limits itself, or the text points outside the sources).
-- The role questions and the applicability question come first; a caller that is not sure of the role asks the role question before the duty questions.

§ `Does the Regulation apply on the date asked`

@export Under Article 16, as a deployer of an AI system, does Chapter III Sections 1 to 3 apply on the date asked?
GIVEN `the date asked` IS A DATE @desc On what date do you want the answer? Give today's date for the Regulation as it stands today, or an earlier or later date for the Regulation as it stood or will stand then.
      `the route by which the AI system is high-risk` IS A `Route to high-risk` @desc Is the AI system high-risk because of Article 6(1) with Annex I, because of Article 6(2) with Annex III, or neither?
      `the date the AI system was placed on the market or put into service` IS A DATE @desc On what date was the AI system first placed on the market or put into service in the Union? If that has not happened yet, give the date you expect.
      `the AI system has been significantly changed in its design since the date of application of Chapter III` IS A BOOLEAN @desc Since the date from which Chapter III of the Regulation applies to your AI system, has its design been significantly changed? Answer no if you do not know of a significant change.
GIVETH A MAYBE BOOLEAN
`Under Article 16, as a deployer of an AI system, does Chapter III Sections 1 to 3 apply on the date asked` MEANS
    JUST (`Art 113 the provision group applies` `Chapter III Sections 1 to 3` `the date asked` `the route by which the AI system is high-risk` `the date the AI system was placed on the market or put into service` `the AI system has been significantly changed in its design since the date of application of Chapter III`)

§ `Which party am I`

@export Under Article 16, as a deployer of an AI system, am I a deployer within the meaning of Article 3(4)?
GIVEN `the party uses an AI system under its authority` IS A BOOLEAN @desc Do you use an AI system under your authority?
      `the AI system is used in the course of a personal non-professional activity` IS A BOOLEAN @desc Do you use it in the course of a personal non-professional activity?
GIVETH A MAYBE BOOLEAN
`Under Article 16, as a deployer of an AI system, am I a deployer within the meaning of Article 3(4)` MEANS
    JUST (`Art 3(4) the party is a deployer` `the party uses an AI system under its authority` `the AI system is used in the course of a personal non-professional activity`)

§ `Article 25`

@export Under Article 25(1), as a deployer of an AI system, am I considered to be the provider of the high-risk AI system?
GIVEN `the date asked` IS A DATE @desc On what date do you want the answer? Give today's date for the Regulation as it stands today, or an earlier or later date for the Regulation as it stood or will stand then.
      `the route by which the AI system is high-risk` IS A `Route to high-risk` @desc Is the AI system high-risk because of Article 6(1) with Annex I, because of Article 6(2) with Annex III, or neither?
      `the date the AI system was placed on the market or put into service` IS A DATE @desc On what date was the AI system first placed on the market or put into service in the Union? If that has not happened yet, give the date you expect.
      `the AI system has been significantly changed in its design since the date of application of Chapter III` IS A BOOLEAN @desc Since the date from which Chapter III of the Regulation applies to your AI system, has its design been significantly changed? Answer no if you do not know of a significant change.
      `the AI system is related to products covered by the Union harmonisation legislation listed in Section B of Annex I` IS A BOOLEAN @desc Is the AI system high-risk because of Article 6(1) and related to a product covered by the Union harmonisation legislation listed in Section B of Annex I? Answer no if you do not know of such a product.
      `Union harmonisation legislation listed in Section A of Annex I lays down requirements or obligations providing an equivalent or higher level of protection` IS A BOOLEAN @desc Where the AI system is high-risk because of Article 6(1), does the Union harmonisation legislation listed in Section A of Annex I lay down requirements or obligations that give an equivalent or higher level of protection of health, safety or fundamental rights than the requirement or obligation the question is about? Answer no if you do not know.
      `limiting the requirement or obligation does not reduce the overall level of protection provided for by this Regulation` IS A BOOLEAN @desc Would limiting the requirement or obligation the question is about leave the overall level of protection provided for by this Regulation unreduced? Answer no if you do not know.
      `the party puts its name or trademark on a high-risk AI system already placed on the market or put into service` IS A BOOLEAN @desc Do you put your name or trademark on a high-risk AI system already placed on the market or put into service?
      `the party makes a change to the AI system after its placing on the market or putting into service` IS A BOOLEAN @desc Do you make a change to the AI system after your placing on the market or putting into service?
      `the change is foreseen or planned in the initial conformity assessment carried out by the provider` IS A BOOLEAN @desc Is it the case that the change is foreseen or planned in the initial conformity assessment carried out by the provider?
      `as a result of the change the compliance of the AI system with the requirements set out in Chapter III, Section 2 is affected` IS A BOOLEAN @desc Is it the case that as a result of the change the compliance of the AI system with the requirements set out in Chapter III, Section 2 is affected?
      `the change results in a modification to the intended purpose for which the AI system has been assessed` IS A BOOLEAN @desc Is it the case that the change results in a modification to the intended purpose for which the AI system has been assessed?
      `the AI system remains a high-risk AI system pursuant to Article 6 after the change` IS A BOOLEAN @desc Is it the case that the AI system remains a high-risk AI system pursuant to Article 6 after the change?
      `the party modifies the intended purpose of an AI system which has not been classified as high-risk and has already been placed on the market or put into service` IS A BOOLEAN @desc Do you modify the intended purpose of an AI system which has not been classified as high-risk and has already been placed on the market or put into service?
      `the AI system concerned becomes a high-risk AI system in accordance with Article 6` IS A BOOLEAN @desc Is it the case that the AI system concerned becomes a high-risk AI system in accordance with Article 6?
GIVETH A MAYBE BOOLEAN
`Under Article 25(1), as a deployer of an AI system, am I considered to be the provider of the high-risk AI system` MEANS
    `Art 25(1) the party is considered to be the provider of the high-risk AI system` `the date asked` `the AI system` `the circumstances` `the party`
    WHERE
        `the AI system` MEANS `AI system` WITH
            `date placed on the market or put into service` IS `the date the AI system was placed on the market or put into service`
            `route` IS `the route by which the AI system is high-risk`
            `significantly changed in its design since the date of application of Chapter III` IS `the AI system has been significantly changed in its design since the date of application of Chapter III`
        `the circumstances` MEANS `Section 3 circumstances` WITH
            `related to Section B products` IS `the AI system is related to products covered by the Union harmonisation legislation listed in Section B of Annex I`
            `Section A equivalent protection` IS `Union harmonisation legislation listed in Section A of Annex I lays down requirements or obligations providing an equivalent or higher level of protection`
            `no reduction of the overall level of protection` IS `limiting the requirement or obligation does not reduce the overall level of protection provided for by this Regulation`
        `the party` MEANS `Art 25(1) what the party has done` OF TRUE, `the party puts its name or trademark on a high-risk AI system already placed on the market or put into service`, `the party makes a change to the AI system after its placing on the market or putting into service`, `the change is foreseen or planned in the initial conformity assessment carried out by the provider`, `as a result of the change the compliance of the AI system with the requirements set out in Chapter III, Section 2 is affected`, `the change results in a modification to the intended purpose for which the AI system has been assessed`, `the AI system remains a high-risk AI system pursuant to Article 6 after the change`, `the party modifies the intended purpose of an AI system which has not been classified as high-risk and has already been placed on the market or put into service`, `the AI system concerned becomes a high-risk AI system in accordance with Article 6`

§ `Article 26`

