      `the deployer has assigned human oversight to natural persons` IS A BOOLEAN @desc Have you assigned human oversight to natural persons?
      `those natural persons have the necessary competence` IS A BOOLEAN @desc Is it the case that those natural persons have the necessary competence?
      `those natural persons have the necessary training` IS A BOOLEAN @desc Is it the case that those natural persons have the necessary training?
      `those natural persons have the necessary authority` IS A BOOLEAN @desc Is it the case that those natural persons have the necessary authority?
