§ `Article 27`

@export Under Article 27(1), as a deployer of an AI system, am I required to perform an assessment of the impact on fundamental rights prior to deploying the high-risk AI system?
GIVEN `the date asked` IS A DATE @desc On what date do you want the answer? Give today's date for the Regulation as it stands today, or an earlier or later date for the Regulation as it stood or will stand then.
      `the route by which the AI system is high-risk` IS A `Route to high-risk` @desc Is the AI system high-risk because of Article 6(1) with Annex I, because of Article 6(2) with Annex III, or neither?
      `the date the AI system was placed on the market or put into service` IS A DATE @desc On what date was the AI system first placed on the market or put into service in the Union? If that has not happened yet, give the date you expect.
      `the AI system has been significantly changed in its design since the date of application of Chapter III` IS A BOOLEAN @desc Since the date from which Chapter III of the Regulation applies to your AI system, has its design been significantly changed? Answer no if you do not know of a significant change.
      `the AI system is related to products covered by the Union harmonisation legislation listed in Section B of Annex I` IS A BOOLEAN @desc Is the AI system high-risk because of Article 6(1) and related to a product covered by the Union harmonisation legislation listed in Section B of Annex I? Answer no if you do not know of such a product.
      `Union harmonisation legislation listed in Section A of Annex I lays down requirements or obligations providing an equivalent or higher level of protection` IS A BOOLEAN @desc Where the AI system is high-risk because of Article 6(1), does the Union harmonisation legislation listed in Section A of Annex I lay down requirements or obligations that give an equivalent or higher level of protection of health, safety or fundamental rights than the requirement or obligation the question is about? Answer no if you do not know.
      `limiting the requirement or obligation does not reduce the overall level of protection provided for by this Regulation` IS A BOOLEAN @desc Would limiting the requirement or obligation the question is about leave the overall level of protection provided for by this Regulation unreduced? Answer no if you do not know.
      `the deployer is a body governed by public law` IS A BOOLEAN @desc Are you a body governed by public law?
      `the deployer is a private entity providing public services` IS A BOOLEAN @desc Are you a private entity providing public services?
      `the high-risk AI system is referred to in points 5 (b) and (c) of Annex III` IS A BOOLEAN @desc Is it the case that the high-risk AI system is referred to in points 5 (b) and (c) of Annex III?
      `the high-risk AI system is intended to be used in the area listed in point 2 of Annex III` IS A BOOLEAN @desc Is it the case that the high-risk AI system is intended to be used in the area listed in point 2 of Annex III?
GIVETH A MAYBE BOOLEAN
`Under Article 27(1), as a deployer of an AI system, am I required to perform an assessment of the impact on fundamental rights prior to deploying the high-risk AI system` MEANS
    `Art 27(1) the deployer is required to perform an assessment of the impact on fundamental rights` `the date asked` `the AI system` `the circumstances` `the facts`
    WHERE
        `the AI system` MEANS `AI system` WITH
            `date placed on the market or put into service` IS `the date the AI system was placed on the market or put into service`
            `route` IS `the route by which the AI system is high-risk`
            `significantly changed in its design since the date of application of Chapter III` IS `the AI system has been significantly changed in its design since the date of application of Chapter III`
        `the circumstances` MEANS `Section 3 circumstances` WITH
            `related to Section B products` IS `the AI system is related to products covered by the Union harmonisation legislation listed in Section B of Annex I`
            `Section A equivalent protection` IS `Union harmonisation legislation listed in Section A of Annex I lays down requirements or obligations providing an equivalent or higher level of protection`
            `no reduction of the overall level of protection` IS `limiting the requirement or obligation does not reduce the overall level of protection provided for by this Regulation`
        `the facts` MEANS `Art 27(1) who and what` OF `the deployer is a body governed by public law`, `the deployer is a private entity providing public services`, `the high-risk AI system is referred to in points 5 (b) and (c) of Annex III`, `the high-risk AI system is intended to be used in the area listed in point 2 of Annex III`

@export Under Article 27(1), as a deployer of an AI system, have I performed the assessment of the impact on fundamental rights, with its points (a) to (f), prior to deploying the high-risk AI system?
GIVEN `the date asked` IS A DATE @desc On what date do you want the answer? Give today's date for the Regulation as it stands today, or an earlier or later date for the Regulation as it stood or will stand then.
      `the route by which the AI system is high-risk` IS A `Route to high-risk` @desc Is the AI system high-risk because of Article 6(1) with Annex I, because of Article 6(2) with Annex III, or neither?
      `the date the AI system was placed on the market or put into service` IS A DATE @desc On what date was the AI system first placed on the market or put into service in the Union? If that has not happened yet, give the date you expect.
      `the AI system has been significantly changed in its design since the date of application of Chapter III` IS A BOOLEAN @desc Since the date from which Chapter III of the Regulation applies to your AI system, has its design been significantly changed? Answer no if you do not know of a significant change.
      `the AI system is related to products covered by the Union harmonisation legislation listed in Section B of Annex I` IS A BOOLEAN @desc Is the AI system high-risk because of Article 6(1) and related to a product covered by the Union harmonisation legislation listed in Section B of Annex I? Answer no if you do not know of such a product.
      `Union harmonisation legislation listed in Section A of Annex I lays down requirements or obligations providing an equivalent or higher level of protection` IS A BOOLEAN @desc Where the AI system is high-risk because of Article 6(1), does the Union harmonisation legislation listed in Section A of Annex I lay down requirements or obligations that give an equivalent or higher level of protection of health, safety or fundamental rights than the requirement or obligation the question is about? Answer no if you do not know.
      `limiting the requirement or obligation does not reduce the overall level of protection provided for by this Regulation` IS A BOOLEAN @desc Would limiting the requirement or obligation the question is about leave the overall level of protection provided for by this Regulation unreduced? Answer no if you do not know.
      `the deployer is a body governed by public law` IS A BOOLEAN @desc Are you a body governed by public law?
      `the deployer is a private entity providing public services` IS A BOOLEAN @desc Are you a private entity providing public services?
      `the high-risk AI system is referred to in points 5 (b) and (c) of Annex III` IS A BOOLEAN @desc Is it the case that the high-risk AI system is referred to in points 5 (b) and (c) of Annex III?
      `the high-risk AI system is intended to be used in the area listed in point 2 of Annex III` IS A BOOLEAN @desc Is it the case that the high-risk AI system is intended to be used in the area listed in point 2 of Annex III?
      `the assessment contains a description of the deployer's processes in which the high-risk AI system will be used in line with its intended purpose` IS A BOOLEAN @desc Is it the case that the assessment contains a description of your processes in which the high-risk AI system will be used in line with its intended purpose?
      `the assessment contains a description of the period of time within which, and the frequency with which, each high-risk AI system is intended to be used` IS A BOOLEAN @desc Is it the case that the assessment contains a description of the period of time within which, and the frequency with which, each high-risk AI system is intended to be used?
      `the assessment contains the categories of natural persons and groups likely to be affected by its use in the specific context` IS A BOOLEAN @desc Is it the case that the assessment contains the categories of natural persons and groups likely to be affected by its use in the specific context?
      `the assessment contains the specific risks of harm likely to have an impact on those categories, taking into account the information given by the provider pursuant to Article 13` IS A BOOLEAN @desc Is it the case that the assessment contains the specific risks of harm likely to have an impact on those categories, taking into account the information given by the provider pursuant to Article 13?
      `the assessment contains a description of the implementation of human oversight measures, according to the instructions for use` IS A BOOLEAN @desc Is it the case that the assessment contains a description of the implementation of human oversight measures, according to the instructions for use?
      `the assessment contains the measures to be taken in the case of the materialisation of those risks, including the arrangements for internal governance and complaint mechanisms` IS A BOOLEAN @desc Is it the case that the assessment contains the measures to be taken in the case of the materialisation of those risks, including the arrangements for internal governance and complaint mechanisms?
      `the assessment was performed prior to deploying the high-risk AI system` IS A BOOLEAN @desc Is it the case that the assessment was performed prior to deploying the high-risk AI system?
GIVETH A MAYBE BOOLEAN
`Under Article 27(1), as a deployer of an AI system, have I performed the assessment of the impact on fundamental rights, with its points (a) to (f), prior to deploying the high-risk AI system` MEANS
    `Art 27(1) the deployer has performed the assessment of the impact on fundamental rights prior to deploying the system` `the date asked` `the AI system` `the circumstances` `the facts` `the assessment` `the assessment was performed prior to deploying the high-risk AI system`
    WHERE
        `the AI system` MEANS `AI system` WITH
            `date placed on the market or put into service` IS `the date the AI system was placed on the market or put into service`
            `route` IS `the route by which the AI system is high-risk`
            `significantly changed in its design since the date of application of Chapter III` IS `the AI system has been significantly changed in its design since the date of application of Chapter III`
        `the circumstances` MEANS `Section 3 circumstances` WITH
            `related to Section B products` IS `the AI system is related to products covered by the Union harmonisation legislation listed in Section B of Annex I`
            `Section A equivalent protection` IS `Union harmonisation legislation listed in Section A of Annex I lays down requirements or obligations providing an equivalent or higher level of protection`
            `no reduction of the overall level of protection` IS `limiting the requirement or obligation does not reduce the overall level of protection provided for by this Regulation`
        `the facts` MEANS `Art 27(1) who and what` OF `the deployer is a body governed by public law`, `the deployer is a private entity providing public services`, `the high-risk AI system is referred to in points 5 (b) and (c) of Annex III`, `the high-risk AI system is intended to be used in the area listed in point 2 of Annex III`
        `the assessment` MEANS `Art 27(1) the assessment` OF `the assessment contains a description of the deployer's processes in which the high-risk AI system will be used in line with its intended purpose`, `the assessment contains a description of the period of time within which, and the frequency with which, each high-risk AI system is intended to be used`, `the assessment contains the categories of natural persons and groups likely to be affected by its use in the specific context`, `the assessment contains the specific risks of harm likely to have an impact on those categories, taking into account the information given by the provider pursuant to Article 13`, `the assessment contains a description of the implementation of human oversight measures, according to the instructions for use`, `the assessment contains the measures to be taken in the case of the materialisation of those risks, including the arrangements for internal governance and complaint mechanisms`

@export Under Article 27(2), as a deployer of an AI system, does my obligation to assess the impact on fundamental rights apply to this use?
GIVEN `the date asked` IS A DATE @desc On what date do you want the answer? Give today's date for the Regulation as it stands today, or an earlier or later date for the Regulation as it stood or will stand then.
      `the route by which the AI system is high-risk` IS A `Route to high-risk` @desc Is the AI system high-risk because of Article 6(1) with Annex I, because of Article 6(2) with Annex III, or neither?
      `the date the AI system was placed on the market or put into service` IS A DATE @desc On what date was the AI system first placed on the market or put into service in the Union? If that has not happened yet, give the date you expect.
      `the AI system has been significantly changed in its design since the date of application of Chapter III` IS A BOOLEAN @desc Since the date from which Chapter III of the Regulation applies to your AI system, has its design been significantly changed? Answer no if you do not know of a significant change.
      `the AI system is related to products covered by the Union harmonisation legislation listed in Section B of Annex I` IS A BOOLEAN @desc Is the AI system high-risk because of Article 6(1) and related to a product covered by the Union harmonisation legislation listed in Section B of Annex I? Answer no if you do not know of such a product.
      `Union harmonisation legislation listed in Section A of Annex I lays down requirements or obligations providing an equivalent or higher level of protection` IS A BOOLEAN @desc Where the AI system is high-risk because of Article 6(1), does the Union harmonisation legislation listed in Section A of Annex I lay down requirements or obligations that give an equivalent or higher level of protection of health, safety or fundamental rights than the requirement or obligation the question is about? Answer no if you do not know.
      `limiting the requirement or obligation does not reduce the overall level of protection provided for by this Regulation` IS A BOOLEAN @desc Would limiting the requirement or obligation the question is about leave the overall level of protection provided for by this Regulation unreduced? Answer no if you do not know.
      `the use is the first use of the high-risk AI system` IS A BOOLEAN @desc Is it the case that the use is the first use of the high-risk AI system?
GIVETH A MAYBE BOOLEAN
`Under Article 27(2), as a deployer of an AI system, does my obligation to assess the impact on fundamental rights apply to this use` MEANS
    `Art 27(2) the obligation laid down in paragraph 1 applies to the use` `the date asked` `the AI system` `the circumstances` `the use is the first use of the high-risk AI system`
    WHERE
        `the AI system` MEANS `AI system` WITH
            `date placed on the market or put into service` IS `the date the AI system was placed on the market or put into service`
            `route` IS `the route by which the AI system is high-risk`
            `significantly changed in its design since the date of application of Chapter III` IS `the AI system has been significantly changed in its design since the date of application of Chapter III`
        `the circumstances` MEANS `Section 3 circumstances` WITH
            `related to Section B products` IS `the AI system is related to products covered by the Union harmonisation legislation listed in Section B of Annex I`
            `Section A equivalent protection` IS `Union harmonisation legislation listed in Section A of Annex I lays down requirements or obligations providing an equivalent or higher level of protection`
            `no reduction of the overall level of protection` IS `limiting the requirement or obligation does not reduce the overall level of protection provided for by this Regulation`

