-- ====================================================================================================
-- seat questions of seat deployer from part P6 (merged; unchanged text follows)
-- ====================================================================================================
-- P6-seat-deployer: the seat layer of part P6 (Articles 50 to 56, Annexes XI, XII, XIII) for a deployer of an AI system
-- (Regulation (EU) 2024/1689 as amended by Regulation (EU) 2026/1744; the consolidated text of 27.7.2026 is a rendering with no legal effect). GENERATED by work/gen_seats.py.
-- SEAT: a deployer of an AI system. A seat module assumes its role: the person asking holds it. Every question calls one layer-1 function of part P6 and restates no rule;
-- the inputs are plain (yes/no, a date, a number, one of the keel's own choices), each with an @desc in the words the seat would be asked; the records the layer-1 functions expect are built in a WHERE.
-- The answer is JUST TRUE ("yes"), JUST FALSE (the text says no in its own words) or NOTHING ("not covered": before the provision applies, or outside what its wording reaches): see NOTES.md, Reading a result.
-- Commencement is IN for this Regulation (assumed, not ruled): every question applies the date Article 113 gives the provision's group, and Article 111 where it bears.

§ `Roles and applicability`

-- role or applicability question, calling the keel's function or the group applicability function
@export Under Article 50, as a deployer of an AI system, am I a deployer of an AI system?
GIVEN `the party uses an AI system under its authority` IS A BOOLEAN @desc Do you use an AI system under your authority?
      `the AI system is used in the course of a personal non-professional activity` IS A BOOLEAN @desc Do you use it in the course of a personal non-professional activity?
GIVETH A MAYBE BOOLEAN
DECIDE `Under Article 50, as a deployer of an AI system, am I a deployer of an AI system` IS
    JUST (`Art 3(4) the party is a deployer` `the party uses an AI system under its authority` `the AI system is used in the course of a personal non-professional activity`)

-- role or applicability question, calling the keel's function or the group applicability function
@export Under Article 50, as a deployer of an AI system, does General apply on the date asked?
GIVEN `the date asked` IS A DATE @desc On what date do you want the answer? Give today's date for the Regulation as it stands today, or an earlier or later date for the Regulation as it stood or will stand then.
      `the route by which the AI system is high-risk` IS A `Route to high-risk` @desc Is the AI system high-risk because of Article 6(1) with Annex I, because of Article 6(2) with Annex III, or neither?
      `the date the AI system was placed on the market or put into service` IS A DATE @desc On what date was the AI system first placed on the market or put into service in the Union? If that has not happened yet, give the date you expect.
      `the AI system has been significantly changed in its design since the date of application of Chapter III` IS A BOOLEAN @desc Since the date from which Chapter III of the Regulation applies to your AI system, has its design been significantly changed? Answer no if you do not know of a significant change.
GIVETH A MAYBE BOOLEAN
DECIDE `Under Article 50, as a deployer of an AI system, does General apply on the date asked` IS
    JUST (`Art 50 the group General applies to the AI system on the date asked` `the date asked` `the AI system`)
    WHERE
        `the AI system` MEANS `AI system` WITH
            `date placed on the market or put into service` IS `the date the AI system was placed on the market or put into service`
            `route` IS `the route by which the AI system is high-risk`
            `significantly changed in its design since the date of application of Chapter III` IS `the AI system has been significantly changed in its design since the date of application of Chapter III`

§ `Under Article 50`
-- SITUATION: Paragraphs 3 and 4 arise only if the deployer uses an emotion recognition system, a biometric categorisation system, or an AI system that generates or manipulates image, audio, video or text content published to the public; paragraphs 5 and 6 reach every deployer of such a system; the form can first ask "Do you use an AI system that recognises emotions, categorises people biometrically, or generates content?".

-- Article 50(3): Art 50(3) the deployer must inform the natural persons exposed to the operation of the system
@export Under Article 50(3), as a deployer of an AI system, must I inform the natural persons exposed to the operation of the emotion recognition or biometric categorisation system?
GIVEN `the date asked` IS A DATE @desc On what date do you want the answer? Give today's date for the Regulation as it stands today, or an earlier or later date for the Regulation as it stood or will stand then.
      `the route by which the AI system is high-risk` IS A `Route to high-risk` @desc Is the AI system high-risk because of Article 6(1) with Annex I, because of Article 6(2) with Annex III, or neither?
      `the date the AI system was placed on the market or put into service` IS A DATE @desc On what date was the AI system first placed on the market or put into service in the Union? If that has not happened yet, give the date you expect.
      `the AI system has been significantly changed in its design since the date of application of Chapter III` IS A BOOLEAN @desc Since the date from which Chapter III of the Regulation applies to your AI system, has its design been significantly changed? Answer no if you do not know of a significant change.
      `the AI system is an emotion recognition system` IS A BOOLEAN @desc Is it true that the AI system is an emotion recognition system?
      `the AI system is a biometric categorisation system` IS A BOOLEAN @desc Is it true that the AI system is a biometric categorisation system?
      `the AI system is used for biometric categorisation or emotion recognition which is permitted by law to detect, prevent or investigate criminal offences` IS A BOOLEAN @desc Is it true that the AI system is used for biometric categorisation or emotion recognition which is permitted by law to detect, prevent or investigate criminal offences?
      `that use is subject to appropriate safeguards for the rights and freedoms of third parties` IS A BOOLEAN @desc Is it true that that use is subject to appropriate safeguards for the rights and freedoms of third parties?
      `that use is in accordance with Union law` IS A BOOLEAN @desc Is it true that that use is in accordance with Union law?
      `the products are covered by Union harmonisation legislation listed in Section B of Annex I` IS A BOOLEAN @desc Is the AI system related to a product covered by the Union harmonisation legislation listed in Section B of Annex I? Answer no if the AI system is not high-risk because of Article 6(1).
GIVETH A MAYBE BOOLEAN
DECIDE `Under Article 50(3), as a deployer of an AI system, must I inform the natural persons exposed to the operation of the emotion recognition or biometric categorisation system` IS
    `Art 50(3) the deployer must inform the natural persons exposed to the operation of the system` `the date asked` `the AI system` `the AI system is an emotion recognition system` `the AI system is a biometric categorisation system` `the AI system is used for biometric categorisation or emotion recognition which is permitted by law to detect, prevent or investigate criminal offences` `that use is subject to appropriate safeguards for the rights and freedoms of third parties` `that use is in accordance with Union law` `the products are covered by Union harmonisation legislation listed in Section B of Annex I`
    WHERE
        `the AI system` MEANS `AI system` WITH
            `date placed on the market or put into service` IS `the date the AI system was placed on the market or put into service`
            `route` IS `the route by which the AI system is high-risk`
            `significantly changed in its design since the date of application of Chapter III` IS `the AI system has been significantly changed in its design since the date of application of Chapter III`

