      `the deployer enters the data listed in Section C of Annex VIII into the EU database in accordance with Article 49(3) and (4)` IS A BOOLEAN @desc Is it true that the deployer enters the data listed in Section C of Annex VIII into the EU database in accordance with Article 49(3) and (4)? Answer yes or no.
GIVETH A MAYBE BOOLEAN
