    `Art 71(3) the data listed in Section C of Annex VIII have been entered into the EU database by the deployer` `the date asked` `the deployer is, or acts on behalf of, a public authority, agency or body` `the deployer enters the data listed in Section C of Annex VIII into the EU database in accordance with Article 49(3) and (4)`

-- Article 71(6), second sentence.
@export Under Article 71, as a deployer of an AI system, has the Commission made adequate technical and administrative support available to me for the EU database?
GIVEN `the date asked` IS A DATE @desc On what date do you want the answer? Give today's date for the Regulation as it stands today, or an earlier or later date for the Regulation as it stood or will stand then.
      `the Commission makes adequate technical support available to providers, prospective providers and deployers` IS A BOOLEAN @desc Is it true that the Commission makes adequate technical support available to providers, prospective providers and deployers? Answer yes or no.
      `the Commission makes adequate administrative support available to providers, prospective providers and deployers` IS A BOOLEAN @desc Is it true that the Commission makes adequate administrative support available to providers, prospective providers and deployers? Answer yes or no.
GIVETH A MAYBE BOOLEAN
DECIDE `Under Article 71, as a deployer of an AI system, has the Commission made adequate technical and administrative support available to me for the EU database` IS
    `Art 71(6) the Commission has made adequate technical and administrative support available to providers, prospective providers and deployers` `the date asked` `the Commission makes adequate technical support available to providers, prospective providers and deployers` `the Commission makes adequate administrative support available to providers, prospective providers and deployers`

-- ====================================================================================================
-- seat questions of seat deployer from part P8 (merged; unchanged text follows)
-- ====================================================================================================
-- P8 seat layer: a deployer of an AI system: the provisions of Articles 72 to 79 that address the deployer, and what the AI Office may do to an operator.
-- SEAT: a deployer of an AI system
--
-- Nothing here is new law: each question calls the layer-1 function of Articles 72 to 79 (P8-art72 to P8-art79) that answers it, and the keel
-- (aia-definitions, aia-timeline, aia-core) for the role facts and the dates. Every question takes plain inputs: a yes/no, a date, a number or
-- one of the keel's own choices, each with an @desc worded for the person asking. A question answers JUST value, or NOTHING where the text does
-- not decide it (the Regulation does not apply yet on the date asked, or the text is silent); a JUST FALSE is a "no" the text itself gives.
-- Questions are grouped by Article in the order of the text; the role question and the applicability questions come first.


§ `The role the person asking holds`

-- The role, worked out by the keel's definition; the other questions of this seat assume it.
@export Under Article 72, as a deployer of an AI system, am I a deployer within the meaning of Article 3(4)?
GIVEN `the party uses an AI system under its authority` IS A BOOLEAN @desc Do you use an AI system under your authority?
      `the AI system is used in the course of a personal non-professional activity` IS A BOOLEAN @desc Is the AI system used in the course of a personal non-professional activity?
GIVETH A BOOLEAN
DECIDE `Under Article 72, as a deployer of an AI system, am I a deployer within the meaning of Article 3(4)` IS
    `Art 3(4) the party is a deployer` `the party uses an AI system under its authority` `the AI system is used in the course of a personal non-professional activity`

§ `Which provisions apply on the date asked`

-- Calls the gate helper of P8-gate, which passes the group to the keel's `Art 113 the provision group applies`.
@export Under Article 72, as a deployer of an AI system, does General apply on the date asked?
GIVEN `the date asked` IS A DATE @desc On what date do you want the answer? Give today's date for the Regulation as it stands today, or an earlier or later date for the Regulation as it stood or will stand then.
      `the route by which the AI system is high-risk` IS A `Route to high-risk` @desc Is the AI system high-risk because of Article 6(1) with Annex I, because of Article 6(2) with Annex III, or neither?
      `the date the AI system was placed on the market or put into service` IS A DATE @desc On what date was the AI system first placed on the market or put into service in the Union? If that has not happened yet, give the date you expect.
      `the AI system has been significantly changed in its design since the date of application of Chapter III` IS A BOOLEAN @desc Since the date from which Chapter III of the Regulation applies to your AI system, has its design been significantly changed? Answer no if you do not know of a significant change.
GIVETH A MAYBE BOOLEAN
DECIDE `Under Article 72, as a deployer of an AI system, does General apply on the date asked` IS
    JUST (`Arts 72 to 79 the group General applies to the AI system` `the date asked` `the route by which the AI system is high-risk` `the date the AI system was placed on the market or put into service` `the AI system has been significantly changed in its design since the date of application of Chapter III`)

-- Calls the gate helper of P8-gate, which passes the group to the keel's `Art 113 the provision group applies`.
@export Under Article 78, as a deployer of an AI system, does Notified bodies, GPAI, governance, penalties and Art 78 apply on the date asked?
GIVEN `the date asked` IS A DATE @desc On what date do you want the answer? Give today's date for the Regulation as it stands today, or an earlier or later date for the Regulation as it stood or will stand then.
GIVETH A MAYBE BOOLEAN
DECIDE `Under Article 78, as a deployer of an AI system, does Notified bodies, GPAI, governance, penalties and Art 78 apply on the date asked` IS
    JUST (`Art 78 the group of Article 78 applies on the date asked` `the date asked`)

§ `Article 72: Post-market monitoring by providers and post-market monitoring plan for high-risk AI systems`
-- Asked of a provider of a high-risk AI system; the paragraphs on Section A of Annex I products and on financial institutions arise only if the AI system is of that kind.

-- Calls `Art 72(2) third sentence the obligation to collect, document and analyse data does not cover the data`.
@export Under Article 72(2), as a deployer of an AI system, does the obligation to collect, document and analyse data not cover the sensitive operational data of deployers that are law enforcement authorities?
GIVEN `the date asked` IS A DATE @desc On what date do you want the answer? Give today's date for the Regulation as it stands today, or an earlier or later date for the Regulation as it stood or will stand then.
      `the route by which the AI system is high-risk` IS A `Route to high-risk` @desc Is the AI system high-risk because of Article 6(1) with Annex I, because of Article 6(2) with Annex III, or neither?
      `the date the AI system was placed on the market or put into service` IS A DATE @desc On what date was the AI system first placed on the market or put into service in the Union? If that has not happened yet, give the date you expect.
      `the AI system has been significantly changed in its design since the date of application of Chapter III` IS A BOOLEAN @desc Since the date from which Chapter III of the Regulation applies to your AI system, has its design been significantly changed? Answer no if you do not know of a significant change.
      `the products are covered by Union harmonisation legislation listed in Section B of Annex I` IS A BOOLEAN @desc Is the AI system, which is high-risk under Article 6(1), related to a product covered by the Union harmonisation legislation listed in Section B of Annex I? Answer no if it is not, or if you do not know.
      `the requirements for high-risk AI systems under this Regulation have been integrated in that Union harmonisation legislation` IS A BOOLEAN @desc Have the requirements for high-risk AI systems under the Regulation been integrated in that Union harmonisation legislation? This does not change the answer to this question; Article 2(2) uses it for other Articles. Answer no if you do not know.
      `the data is sensitive operational data` IS A BOOLEAN @desc Is it the case that the data is sensitive operational data?
      `the deployer is a law enforcement authority` IS A BOOLEAN @desc Is it the case that the deployer is a law enforcement authority?
GIVETH A MAYBE BOOLEAN
DECIDE `Under Article 72(2), as a deployer of an AI system, does the obligation to collect, document and analyse data not cover the sensitive operational data of deployers that are law enforcement authorities` IS
    `Art 72(2) third sentence the obligation to collect, document and analyse data does not cover the data` `the date asked` `the route by which the AI system is high-risk` `the date the AI system was placed on the market or put into service` `the AI system has been significantly changed in its design since the date of application of Chapter III` `the products are covered by Union harmonisation legislation listed in Section B of Annex I` `the requirements for high-risk AI systems under this Regulation have been integrated in that Union harmonisation legislation` `the data is sensitive operational data` `the deployer is a law enforcement authority`

§ `Article 73: Reporting of serious incidents`
-- Arises only after a serious incident of a high-risk AI system placed on the Union market.

-- Seam S10: the serious incident of Article 3(49) is worked out here by the keel's definition; the Article 73 questions take it as a yes/no.
@export Under Article 73, as a deployer of an AI system, is the event a serious incident within the meaning of Article 3(49)?
GIVEN `the event is an incident or malfunctioning of an AI system` IS A BOOLEAN @desc Is the event an incident or malfunctioning of an AI system?
      `it directly or indirectly leads to the death of a person, or serious harm to a person's health` IS A BOOLEAN @desc Does the event directly or indirectly lead to the death of a person, or serious harm to a person's health?
      `it directly or indirectly leads to a serious and irreversible disruption of the management or operation of critical infrastructure` IS A BOOLEAN @desc Does the event directly or indirectly lead to a serious and irreversible disruption of the management or operation of critical infrastructure?
      `it directly or indirectly leads to the infringement of obligations under Union law intended to protect fundamental rights` IS A BOOLEAN @desc Does the event directly or indirectly lead to the infringement of obligations under Union law intended to protect fundamental rights?
      `it directly or indirectly leads to serious harm to property or the environment` IS A BOOLEAN @desc Does the event directly or indirectly lead to serious harm to property or the environment?
GIVETH A BOOLEAN
DECIDE `Under Article 73, as a deployer of an AI system, is the event a serious incident within the meaning of Article 3(49)` IS
    `Art 3(49) the event is a serious incident` `the event is an incident or malfunctioning of an AI system` `it directly or indirectly leads to the death of a person, or serious harm to a person's health` `it directly or indirectly leads to a serious and irreversible disruption of the management or operation of critical infrastructure` `it directly or indirectly leads to the infringement of obligations under Union law intended to protect fundamental rights` `it directly or indirectly leads to serious harm to property or the environment`

-- Calls `Art 73(5) the provider or the deployer may submit an initial report that is incomplete, followed by a complete report`.
